:200,"startLineOffset":49,"endLine":200,"endLineOffset":58,"length":10}]}]},{"comment":"The test cases cover various scenarios, but they do not explicitly verify that `shouldRecreateDestinationIndex` is set correctly when a recoverable exception occurs. It would be beneficial to add a test case specifically for this scenario to ensure the logic behaves as expected.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java-x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java--39829:40330","promptId":"#KT2XJ","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":39829,"endPos":40330,"startLine":963,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":973,"endLineOffset":5,"length":502}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java-x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java--41830:42607","promptId":"#1PTZA","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":41830,"endPos":42607,"startLine":1013,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":1030,"endLineOffset":5,"length":778}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/transforms/TransformIndexerFailureHandlingTests.java-x-pack/plugin/transform/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/transform/tr